 {
  "text": "Hello everybody, this is Linda, from the Miami office. A quick note about the team beach day. It is on Saturday, at ten in the morning, at Crandon Park. How do you get there? Take a taxi, or go by car. It is twenty minutes from the office. What do you bring? A hat, water, and your family! The food is free. If it rains, we go to the mall, to a restaurant on the second floor. See you on Saturday!",
  "voice": "ellen",
  "file": "a13_listening1.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "Hi, this is Paul again. In Miami, people love the weekend. What do they do? On Saturday, many people go to the beach, or to a park. On Sunday, families go to the mall, because it is cool inside, and it is very hot outside. Some people have a short trip to Key West. It is three hours by car. My advice: say yes to one invitation. A Saturday with the team is better than ten meetings.",
  "voice": "arthur",
  "file": "a13_listening2.mp3"
 },
 {
